│ patch_description        │ This edit keeps the block size fixed but improves the inductive bias and parameter        │
│                          │ efficiency of the ansatz.                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Main changes:                                                                             │
│                          │ - Replace the nearest-neighbor CZ ring with a butterfly-style CZ pattern that couples     │
│                          │ opposite halves of the 8-qubit register first, then cross-links within each half. This is │
│                          │ a better match for the fixed ZZ feature map, which already injects pairwise correlations  │
│                          │ across arbitrary feature-pairs.                                                           │
│                          │ - Keep the initial independent RY layer so each qubit can still learn a distinct local    │
│                          │ basis.                                                                                    │
│                          │ - Compress the final RZ layer by sharing phase parameters across mirrored qubit pairs,    │
│                          │ reducing the number of trainable circuit parameters per block from 14 to 12 without       │
│                          │ changing the gate count.                                                                  │
│                          │ - Preserve the same overall structure expected by the fixed training loop, so the change  │
│                          │ is safe and compatible.                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should help validation/test stability and parameter efficiency while remaining       │
│                          │ expressive enough for the re-uploading architecture.                                      │
