│ patch_description        │ Improve the ansatz expressivity and validation loss by introducing parametrized two-qubit │
│                          │ gates (CRX) and ensuring full Bloch sphere coverage for each qubit. The new block         │
│                          │ consists of an RY rotation layer, followed by a circular entanglement pattern of CRX      │
│                          │ gates, and a final RZ rotation layer. This increases the parameter count per block from   │
│                          │ 16 to 24 (total 146), which is expected to lower the validation loss significantly        │
│                          │ (aiming for &lt;0.12) based on prior performance trends where higher-parameter models     │
